<title>USA: Roberds May same-store sales down 8.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Roberds May same-store sales down 8.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTON, Ohio 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roberds Inc Tuesday reported sales for May and the first five months of the year.</p>
<p>	     Sales in millions of dollars     Percent change</p>
<p>		     1997	 1996	Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$27.4	$23.6     +16.0	 -8.5</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $136.4     $118.3     +15.3	-10.4</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
